y": "Sanarara R is a multi-ending visual novel about a young man approached by a mysterious girl who claims she can grant any wish. Explore seven heroine routes, each with its own story and ending, through fully voiced Japanese dialogue, except for the protagonist. This version adds stories for Higuchi, Kanae, and Hikaru, extra scenarios from the fan discs, widescreen graphics, and a gallery mode.", "themes": [{"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sanarara-r"}